  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "視線這東西，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳不覺得很恐怖嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89967DDA90196771897FFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0D89BA5F975F886050601655CEFF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蠻恐怖的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "883B6050601676840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼了嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC4E8655CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有件事希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能幫幫我……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094EF64E8B5E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5E6B5E6B62112026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家隔壁搬來了一個\n從帕底亞地區來的人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB6969458C1642C4F864E864E00500B000A5F9E5E155E954E9E573053404F8676844EBA300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那個人帶的寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3500B4EBA5E3676845BF653EF59222026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "時時刻刻、隨時隨地，\n都直直盯著我可愛的巨鉗螳螂！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66426642523B523B300196A8664296A85730FF0C000A90FD76F476F476EF8457621153EF611B76845DE8925787B38782FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家的巨鉗螳螂有點膽小，\n每天都怕得瑟瑟發抖啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB676845DE8925787B3878267099EDE81BD5C0FFF0C000A6BCF592990FD60155F97745F745F767C6296554AFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鄰居那隻寶可夢……巧鍛匠牠\n直盯著巨鉗螳螂到底是在打什麼主意？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我調查！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91305C4590A396BB5BF653EF5922202620265DE7935B53207260000A76F476EF84575DE8925787B3878252305E95662F572862534EC09EBC4E3B610FFF1F00100001BE00000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B62118ABF67E5FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金甘……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D17518202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我猜那個鄰居現在是在屋頂。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211731C90A3500B91305C4573FE5728662F57285C4B9802300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請問……\n有什麼事嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB554F20262026000A67094EC09EBC4E8B55CEFF1F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想聊聊巧鍛匠的事",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F3804A804A5DE7935B532076844E8B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想聊聊巨鉗螳螂的事",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F3804A804A5DE8925787B3878276844E8B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n是關於鄰居先生的寶可夢對不對。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01000A662F95DC65BC91305C455148751F76845BF653EF59225C0D4E0D5C0D300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧鍛匠一直盯著巨鉗螳螂看，\n這的確是真的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7935B53204E0076F476EF84575DE8925787B38782770BFF0C000A9019768478BA662F771F7684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鄰居先生的巨鉗螳螂，該怎麼說呢，\n牠的眼神好凶惡？還是說恐怖……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n巧鍛匠直盯著牠，是為了戒備。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91305C455148751F76845DE8925787B38782FF0C8A72600E9EBC8AAA5462FF0C000A72607684773C795E597D51F660E1FF1F9084662F8AAA605060162026202600100001BE00000A5DE7935B532076F476EF84577260FF0C662F70BA4E8662125099300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說穿了不過就是這樣，\n但默默被注視，的確是挺恐怖的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA7A7F4E864E0D904E5C31662F90196A23FF0C000A4F469ED89ED888AB6CE88996FF0C768478BA662F633A605060167684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位訓練家，如果方便的話，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把剛才我說的告訴鄰居先生吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C5982679C65B94FBF76848A71FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3628A525B624D62118AAA7684544A8A3491305C455148751F5427300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以隔壁的巧鍛匠是為什麼\n要直盯著巨鉗螳螂看呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5969458C176845DE7935B5320662F70BA4EC09EBC000A898176F476EF84575DE8925787B38782770B5462FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為巨鉗螳螂的眼神",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA5DE8925787B387827684773C795E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為怕巨鉗螳螂",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA60155DE8925787B387820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼？因為巨鉗螳螂眼神凶惡，\n所以才會直盯著牠看……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF1F56E070BA5DE8925787B38782773C795E51F660E1FF0C000A62404EE5624D670376F476EF84577260770B2026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼？\n牠在戒備巨鉗螳螂？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF1F000A72605728621250995DE8925787B38782FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那真是抱歉了，\n巨鉗螳螂牠天生就是這副眼神。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3771F662F62B16B494E86FF0C000A5DE8925787B3878272605929751F5C31662F9019526F773C795E300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算是在戒備……\n默不吭聲直勾勾地盯著人家，很恐怖啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97662F57286212509920262026000A9ED84E0D542D807276F452FE52FE573076EF84574EBA5BB6FF0C5F8860506016554AFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然就這樣被剛搬來的\n半生不熟的人和寶可夢<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n剝奪了我平靜的生活！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF71365C3190196A2388AB525B642C4F867684000A534A751F4E0D719F76844EBA548C5BF653EF592200100001BE00000A525D596A4E8662115E73975C7684751F6D3BFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到底，聽說巧鍛匠會為了\n收集金屬去襲擊其他的寶可夢啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n該不會因為巨鉗螳螂是鋼屬性，\n所以牠……？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52305E95FF0C807D8AAA5DE7935B5320670370BA4E86000A653696C691D15C6C53BB897264CA51764ED676845BF653EF5922554A300200100001BE01000A8A724E0D670356E070BA5DE8925787B38782662F92FC5C6C6027FF0C000A62404EE5726020262026FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "堂……！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "580220262026FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你放心，巨鉗螳螂！\n真有萬一的話，我會保護你的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60653E5FC3FF0C5DE8925787B38782FF01000A771F6709842C4E0076848A71FF0C621167034FDD8B774F607684300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "除非能確定隔壁住的是個可以放心的人，\n不然巨鉗螳螂牠會一直都很不安啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9664975E80FD78BA5B9A969458C14F4F7684662F500B53EF4EE5653E5FC376844EBAFF0C000A4E0D71365DE8925787B38782726067034E0076F490FD5F884E0D5B89554AFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟隔壁人家才剛搬來，\n我猜她也很不容易，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能委婉地代我轉告就太好了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF969458C14EBA5BB6624D525B642C4F86FF0C000A6211731C59794E5F5F884E0D5BB96613FF0C00100001BE00000A5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD59D45A4957304EE362118F49544A5C31592A597D4E86300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "堂……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5802202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那位鄰居先生怎麼說呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F4D91305C455148751F600E9EBC8AAA5462FF1F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被盯著看好恐怖",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB76EF8457770B597D605060160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧鍛匠好可怕",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7935B5320597D53EF60150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣啊，\n鄰居先生這麼說嗎……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A23554AFF0C000A91305C455148751F90199EBC8AAA55CE2026202600100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧鍛匠是個乖孩子，\n什麼都不懂就說人家可怕，太過分了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7935B5320662F500B4E565B695B50FF0C000A4EC09EBC90FD4E0D61C25C318AAA4EBA5BB653EF6015FF0C592A904E52064E86FF0100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的巧鍛匠牠\n就算是要收集金屬，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也才不會去襲擊寶可夢呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845DE7935B53207260000A5C317B97662F8981653696C691D15C6CFF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F624D4E0D670353BB897264CA5BF653EF59225462300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……幾乎不會。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620265E7E4E4E4E0D6703300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE75462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們也才剛搬來這裡，\n不安的事情可多了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n莫名其妙被說可怕，也很困惑。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150114E5F624D525B642C4F86901988E1FF0C000A4E0D5B8976844E8B60C553EF591A4E86FF0C00100001BE00000A83AB540D5176599988AB8AAA53EF6015FF0C4E5F5F8856F060D1300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "反倒是我想找鄰居先生證明\n他的巨鉗螳螂真的沒在瞪我們呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53CD5012662F621160F3627E91305C455148751F8B49660E000A4ED676845DE8925787B38782771F76846C92572877AA621150115462300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE75462202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鄰居她怎麼說？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91305C455979600E9EBC8AAAFF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想知道巨鉗螳螂是不是在瞪她們",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F377E590535DE8925787B38782662F4E0D662F572877AA597950110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請放心，巧鍛匠不會襲擊巨鉗螳螂",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB653E5FC3FF0C5DE7935B53204E0D6703897264CA5DE8925787B387820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家膽小的巨鉗螳螂\n哪有可能會去瞪人家！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB681BD5C0F76845DE8925787B38782000A54EA670953EF80FD670353BB77AA4EBA5BB6FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算說牠不會襲擊過來，\n那也是口說無憑啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B978AAA72604E0D6703897264CA904E4F86FF0C000A90A34E5F662F53E38AAA71216191554A300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好吧，畢竟是乍到異鄉，\n我能理解鄰居會有許多不安，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但我們可是從以前就住在這兒的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5427FF0C75627ADF662F4E4D523075709109FF0C000A621180FD740689E391305C45670367098A31591A4E0D5B89FF0C00100001BE00000A4F466211501153EF662F5F9E4EE5524D5C314F4F5728901951527684FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道了！\n那我來證明巨鉗螳螂沒在瞪對方吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534E86FF01000A90A362114F868B49660E5DE8925787B387826C92572877AA5C0D65B95427300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼做？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC505AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能證明嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD8B49660E55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要讓巨鉗螳螂和巧鍛匠見面。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818B935DE8925787B38782548C5DE7935B5320898B9762300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟有訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̃先生你小姐妳在場的話，\n我們這邊也放心。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF67098A137DF45BB600100003110000FF03035148751F4F605C0F59D059B35728583476848A71FF0C000A621150119019908A4E5F653E5FC3300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果鄰居她不反對的話，\n我們就讓2隻寶可夢見個面吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C91305C4559794E0D53CD5C0D76848A71FF0C000A621150115C318B93003296BB5BF653EF5922898B500B97625427FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金甘甘。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D17518751830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓巧鍛匠和巨鉗螳螂見面……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B935DE7935B5320548C5DE8925787B38782898B97622026202600100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534E86FF0100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟有人戒備著我和巧鍛匠，\n對我們也是一種壓力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF67094EBA6212509984576211548C5DE7935B5320FF0C000A5C0D621150114E5F662F4E007A2E58D3529B300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們會證明巧鍛匠牠\n不會襲擊巨鉗螳螂的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501167038B49660E5DE7935B53207260000A4E0D6703897264CA5DE8925787B387827684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒問題吧，巧鍛匠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92554F984C5427FF0C5DE7935B5320300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE75462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿E",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下來，\n我們要讓彼此的寶可夢見面……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B4F86FF0C000A6211501189818B935F7C6B6476845BF653EF5922898B97622026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先說好了，如果發生什麼事，\n我們就立刻讓牠們回到球裡。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51488AAA597D4E86FF0C5982679C767C751F4EC09EBC4E8BFF0C000A621150115C317ACB523B8B937260501156DE5230740388E1300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，巨鉗螳螂！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C5DE8925787B38782FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧鍛匠，來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7935B5320FF0C4F86300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧鍛匠在害羞？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7935B532057285BB37F9EFF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨鉗螳螂在害怕？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE8925787B3878257285BB36015FF1F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE75462266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金甘……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D17518202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但巧鍛匠沒有襲擊過來。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465DE7935B53206C926709897264CA904E4F86300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨鉗螳螂也只是眼神凶凶的而已……\n看來我們都誤會對方了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE8925787B387824E5F53EA662F773C795E51F651F67684800C5DF220262026000A770B4F866211501190FD8AA467035C0D65B94E86300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金甘！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 4072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D17518FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 4080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE75462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢之間的距離似乎也變近了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 4088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59224E4B959376848DDD96E24F3C4E4E4E5F8B8A8FD14E86300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊。我們才剛到密阿雷，\n有好多事情都不清楚，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n如果遇到什麼問題時，麻煩請你幫忙了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 4128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A300262115011624D525B52305BC6963F96F7FF0C000A6709597D591A4E8B60C590FD4E0D6E05695AFF0C00100001BE00000A5982679C904752304EC09EBC554F984C6642FF0C9EBB71698ACB4F605E6B5FD94E86300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位訓練家，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳今天幫了這麼多忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 4228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34ECA59295E6B4E8690199EBC591A5FD9300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！巧鍛匠，\n不可以隨手去拔人家的金屬！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 4288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF015DE7935B5320FF0C000A4E0D53EF4EE596A8624B53BB62D44EBA5BB6768491D15C6CFF01FF0100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真、真的沒問題嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F3001771F76846C92554F984C55CEFF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "堂啷啷……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 4368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "580255775577202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧～呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 4380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7FF5E5462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿Y",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 4392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和冶蕾蘿她\n最近會聊東聊西的呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n巨鉗螳螂和巧鍛匠\n相處得也挺好的……目前來說。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C51B6857E863F5979000A67008FD16703804A6771804A897F76845462300200100001BE01000A5DE8925787B38782548C5DE7935B5320000A76F886555F974E5F633A597D76842026202676EE524D4F868AAA300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金甘～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 4504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D17518FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在從希司佐他那裡學\n各種關於密阿雷的事喔！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n巧鍛匠也好喜歡黏著巨鉗螳螂。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B6357285F9E5E0C53F84F504ED690A388E15B78000A54047A2E95DC65BC5BC6963F96F776844E8B5594FF0100100001BE01000A5DE7935B53204E5F597D559C6B619ECF84575DE8925787B38782300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE75462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
